  "provenance": {
    "source": "archetype",
    "note": "Raw structure as the aesthetic: pure white field, near-black ink, zero radius, zero shadow. Typography does all the expressive work — Archivo at display sizes with Space Mono for data. Don't add elevation, don't round corners, don't tint the neutrals; the moment anything softens it stops being brutalist."
